| Method | Backbone |
|--------|---------|
| `guwenbert_crf` | `ethanyt/guwenbert-base` |
| `roberta_bilstm_crf` | `hfl/chinese-roberta-wwm-ext` |
| `roberta_kan_crf` | `hfl/chinese-roberta-wwm-ext` |
